The duties of Ms. Hülya SATIR, a Independent Member of the Board of Directors, in the Audit Committee, Committee of Early Detection of Risk and Corporate Governance Committee be terminated; and that Mr. Hüsnü Cemal YANGÖZ, an Independent Member of the Board of Directors, be appointed as the Member of the Audit Committee, Member of the Early Detection of Risk Committee and Chairman of the Corporate Governance Committee, replacing Ms. Hülya SATIR.

